      </h2>
              <div class="aalto-manual-liftup__header-body">            <div class="aalto-user-generated-content"><p>New generations of multidisciplinary scientists and engineers are educated by engaging them with cutting-edge science and technology. Our strong emphasis on research is also reflected in our wide-ranging collaborations, the highly international composition of our staff, and a broad spectrum of funding sources.</p></div>
