                      </a>
        </h3>
        <span class="aalto-tile__summary">  Welcome to our ABC Seminars! This time, Ole Jensen (University of Oxford) will discuss the evolution of the functional interpretation of the human alpha rhythm over the past century, including recent conceptual shifts framing it as a rhythm coordinating perception, attention, and action.
